### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password"
}

### 파이프라인 생성
POST http://localhost:8000/pipelines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "테스트 파이프라인"
}

### 노드 추가 (PDF 텍스트 추출)
POST http://localhost:8000/pipelines/1/nodes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kind": "pdf_extract",
  "params": {"ocr_fallback": true}
}

### 실행
POST http://localhost:8000/pipelines/1/runs
